flowchart LR
  accTitle: Client segments flow
  accDescr: A relationship manager opens their Clients list, filters by segment, and checks in with dormant clients.
  open[Open Clients] --> any{Any clients assigned?}
  any -- No --> empty[Add a prospect or import a list]
  any -- Yes --> list[See all clients with segment counts]
  list --> search[Search by name]
  list --> segment[Pick Premium, New, or Dormant]
  segment --> dormant[Dormant – no contact in 6+ months]
  dormant --> message[Send a short check-in]
  message --> back[Client replies or books a review]
